html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Ankaboot 29:51 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Apakah tidak cukup bagi mereka bahwa Kami telah menurunkan kepadamu Kitab (Al-Qur`an) yang dibacakan kepada mereka? Sungguh, dalam (Al-Qur`an) itu terdapat\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 51\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-51.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/29.html\">Surah Al-Ankaboot</a> › Ayat 51</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Ankaboot 29:51</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿أَوَلَمْ يَكْفِهِمْ أَنَّا أَنزَلْنَا عَلَيْكَ الْكِتَابَ يُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِمْ إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَرَحْمَةً وَذِكْرَىٰ لِقَوْمٍ يُؤْمِنُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Apakah tidak cukup bagi mereka bahwa Kami telah menurunkan kepadamu Kitab (Al-Qur`an) yang dibacakan kepada mereka? Sungguh, dalam (Al-Qur`an) itu terdapat rahmat yang besar dan pelajaran bagi orang-orang yang beriman.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فزجر من لم يكتف بالكتاب المنزل.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 19/67</cite></blockquote><h3>Yang beliau nukil dari selainnya</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم</span> <span class=\"st\">استشهد به</span> «{عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم أنه رأى بيد عمر بن الخطاب شيئا من التوراة فقال: لو كان موسى حيا ثم اتبعتموه وتركتموني لضللتم.} وفي رواية {ما وسعه إلا اتباعي.}»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 17/41</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأخبر سبحانه أن الكتاب الذي أنزله على رسوله يكفي<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/435</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ففيه الحجة والدلالة على أنه من الله، وأن الله سبحانه أرسل به رسوله وفيه بيان ما يوجب لمن اتبعه السعادة، وينجيه من العذاب،<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/435</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s29a51\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/29-49.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (29:49)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/29-52.html\">Ayat berikutnya (29:52)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/29-52.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Ankaboot 29:52 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Katakanlah (Muhammad), &quot;Cukuplah Allah menjadi saksi antara aku dan kamu. Dia mengetahui apa yang di langit dan di bumi. Dan orang yang percaya kepada yang\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Ankaboot 29:52 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Katakanlah (Muhammad), &quot;Cukuplah Allah menjadi saksi antara aku dan kamu. Dia mengetahui apa yang di langit dan di bumi. Dan orang yang percaya kepada yang\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 52\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-52.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/29.html\">Surah Al-Ankaboot</a> › Ayat 52</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Ankaboot 29:52</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قُلْ كَفَىٰ بِاللَّهِ بَيْنِي وَبَيْنَكُمْ شَهِيدًا يَعْلَمُ مَا فِي السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْأَرْضِ وَالَّذِينَ آمَنُوا بِالْبَاطِلِ وَكَفَرُوا بِاللَّهِ أُولَٰئِكَ هُمُ الْخَاسِرُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Katakanlah (Muhammad), &quot;Cukuplah Allah menjadi saksi antara aku dan kamu. Dia mengetahui apa yang di langit dan di bumi. Dan orang yang percaya kepada yang batil dan ingkar kepada Allah, mereka itulah orang-orang yang rugi.&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإنه إذا كان عالما بالأشياء كانت شهادته بعلم وقد بين شهادته بالآيات الدالة على صدق الرسول ومنها القرآن<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 14/191</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإذا كان الله سبحانه عالما بجميع الأشياء؛ كانت شهادته أصدق شهادة وأعدلها، فإنها شهادة بعلم تام، محيط بالمشهود به، فيكون الشاهد به أعدل الشهداء وأصدقهم،<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/435</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s29a52\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/29-51.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (29:51)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/29-61.html\">Ayat berikutnya (29:61)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/29-61.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Ankaboot 29:61 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dan jika engkau bertanya kepada mereka, &quot;Siapakah yang menciptakan langit dan bumi dan menundukkan matahari dan bulan?&quot; Pasti mereka akan menjawab, &quot;Allah.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Ankaboot 29:61 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dan jika engkau bertanya kepada mereka, &quot;Siapakah yang menciptakan langit dan bumi dan menundukkan matahari dan bulan?&quot; Pasti mereka akan menjawab, &quot;Allah.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 61\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-61.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/29.html\">Surah Al-Ankaboot</a> › Ayat 61</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Ankaboot 29:61</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَئِن سَأَلْتَهُم مَّنْ خَلَقَ السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْأَرْضَ وَسَخَّرَ الشَّمْسَ وَالْقَمَرَ لَيَقُولُنَّ اللَّهُ فَأَنَّىٰ يُؤْفَكُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dan jika engkau bertanya kepada mereka, &quot;Siapakah yang menciptakan langit dan bumi dan menundukkan matahari dan bulan?&quot; Pasti mereka akan menjawab, &quot;Allah.&quot; Maka mengapa mereka bisa dipalingkan (dari kebenaran).</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالكفار المشركون مقرون أن الله خالق السموات والأرض<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 11/51</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولكنهم مع هذا مشركون به في ألوهيته بأن يعبدوا معه آلهة أخرى يتخذونها شفعاء أو شركاء؛ أو في ربوبيته بأن يجعلوا غيره رب بعض الكائنات دونه مع اعترافهم بأنه رب ذلك الرب وخالق ذلك الخلق.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 11/51</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s29a61\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/29-52.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (29:52)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/29-69.html\">Ayat berikutnya (29:69)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/29-69.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Ankaboot 29:69 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dan orang-orang yang berjihad untuk (mencari keridaan) Kami, Kami akan tunjukkan kepada mereka jalan-jalan Kami. Dan sungguh, Allah bersama orang-orang yan\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Ankaboot 29:69 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dan orang-orang yang berjihad untuk (mencari keridaan) Kami, Kami akan tunjukkan kepada mereka jalan-jalan Kami. Dan sungguh, Allah bersama orang-orang yan\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 69\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-69.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/29.html\">Surah Al-Ankaboot</a> › Ayat 69</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Ankaboot 29:69</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَالَّذِينَ جَاهَدُوا فِينَا لَنَهْدِيَنَّهُمْ سُبُلَنَا وَإِنَّ اللَّهَ لَمَعَ الْمُحْسِنِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dan orang-orang yang berjihad untuk (mencari keridaan) Kami, Kami akan tunjukkan kepada mereka jalan-jalan Kami. Dan sungguh, Allah bersama orang-orang yang berbuat baik.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فجعل لمن جاهد فيه هداية جميع سبله تعالى<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 28/442</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإن الكلام فيمن جاهد في سبيل الله لا في سبيل الرياسة ولا في سبيل المال ولا في سبيل الحمية وهذا لا يكون إلا لمن قاتل ليكون الدين كله لله ولتكون كلمة الله هي العليا.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 28/442</cite></blockquote><h3>Yang beliau nukil dari selainnya</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">عبد الله بن المبارك وأحمد بن حنبل وغيرهما</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «ولهذا قال الإمامان عبد الله بن المبارك وأحمد بن حنبل وغيرهما: إذا اختلف الناس في شيء فانظروا ماذا عليه أهل الثغر فإن الحق معهم؛ لأن الله يقول: {والذين جاهدوا فينا لنهدينهم سبلنا} .»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 28/442</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s29a69\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/29-61.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (29:61)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}